-curve\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"icon-box\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i></div>\n                                <h5>Électricité</h5>\n                                <div class=\"text\"><b>Installation</b> et <b>maintenance des systèmes électriques</b>.</div>\n                                <div class=\"link-box\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!--Service Block-->\n                        <div class=\"service-block-two col-xl-3 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 wow fadeInUp\"\n                            data-wow-delay=\"0ms\" data-wow-duration=\"1500ms\">\n                            <div class=\"inner-box\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n                                <div class=\"bottom-curve\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"icon-box\"><i class=\"fas fa-faucet\"></i></div>\n                                <h5>Plomberie Sanitaire</h5>\n                                <div class=\"text\"><b>Installation</b> et <b>maintenance des systèmes de plomberie</b>.</div>\n                                <div class=\"link-box\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!--Service Block-->\n                        <div class=\"service-block-two col-xl-12 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 wow fadeInUp\"\n                            data-wow-delay=\"0ms\" data-wow-duration=\"1500ms\">\n                            <div class=\"inner-box\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n                                <div class=\"bottom-curve\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"icon-box\"><i class=\"fas fa-hammer\"></i></div>\n                                <h5>Ferronnerie</h5>\n                                <div class=\"text\">Conception et fabrication sur mesure de structures métalliques, ainsi\n                                    que l'installation et la maintenance.</div>\n                                <div class=\"link-box\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n<!--Agency Section-->\n\n        <!-- Call To Section -->\n        <section class=\"call-to-section\">\n            <div class=\"auto-container\">\n                <div class=\"inner clearfix\">\n                    <div class=\"shape-1 wow slideInRight\" data-wow-delay=\"0ms\" data-wow-duration=\"1500ms\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"shape-2 wow fadeInDown\" data-wow-delay=\"0ms\" data-wow-duration=\"1500ms\"></div>\n                    <h2>Démarrons votre projet dès aujourd’hui !</h2>\n                    <div class=\"link-box\">\n                        <a class=\"theme-btn btn-style-two\" href=\"contact.html\">\n                            <i class=\"btn-curve\"></i>\n                            <span class=\"btn-title\">OBTENIR UN DEVIS</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Main Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"main-footer\">\n      <div class=\"auto-container\">\n        <!--Widgets Section-->\n        <div class=\"widgets-section\">\n          <div class=\"row clearfix\">\n            <!--Column (logo-widget spanning two columns)-->\n            <div class=\"column col-xl-6 col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n              <div class=\"footer-widget logo-widget\">\n                <div class=\"widget-content\">\n                  <div class=\"logo\">\n                    <a href=\"index-2.html\"><img id=\"fLogo\" src=\"img/logo png/Logo.png\" alt=\"\" /></a>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"text\">\n                    Fondée en 2018, H&K Services est une Société franco-tunisienne de construction\n                    spécialisée dans les projets résidentiels et commerciaux.\n\n                  </div>\n                \n      